  "prefLabel": "Ban 1450.05 Corporate Securities",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-06-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ban 1450.05 Corporate Securities.\n\n(a) All bonds and notes authorized as legal investments for banks under RSA 383-B:303(d)(1), shall qualify as appropriate and acceptable collateral for public funds.\n\n(b) Notwithstanding the provisions of RSA 383-B:303(d)(1), convertible bonds not rated among the 3 highest ratings of any NRSRO shall not qualify as acceptable collateral for public funds.\n\nSource. #5221 (Emergency) eff 9-6-91, EXPIRED 1-7-92; #5307, eff 1-9-92, EXPIRED 5-8-92 (Int 91-9)\n\nNew. #5465, eff 9-8-92, EXPIRED: 9-8-98\n\nNew. #6961, eff 3-25-99, EXPIRED: 3-25-07\n\nNew. #9187, eff 6-24-08, INTERIM, EXPIRED: 12-21-08\n\nNew. #9557, eff 10-3-09; ss by #10997, INTERIM, eff 12-23-15, EXPIRES: 6-20-16; ss by #11113, eff 6-1-16",
